{"rule":"lemma-pool/v1","groups":{"surpreendido":{"host":"e114dc81","siblings":["f077111a"]}},"rows":{"f077111a":{"word":"surpreendida","rank":6455,"meanings":[{"headword":"surpreendido","pos":"adj","source_reference":"kaikki:en-surpreendido-pt-adj-D0ccNHKE","translation":"surprised"}]}},"examples":{"f077111a":{"m":[[{"t":"Devo confessar, Irmã, estou um pouco surpreendida com o seu pedido.","e":"I must say, Sister, I am a little surprised by your request.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.842527,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"03d5d4a02601c754b9d4f9f61c93cec8","i":"05692185aaa01924bcb2306a20aab974","r":"5767252:6919747:816:4677902","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5767252","6919747","816"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Fiquei tão surpreendida e feliz ao saber que me queria ver.","e":"I was so surprised and happy to hear that you wanted to see me.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.838961,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"40acdf7caa48172db45d7c46f94ceb57","i":"0f762718e0954c8e6fe60f5fce1e1411","r":"4897574:6854378:65:3068522","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4897574","6854378","65"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Estou surpreendida por não teres acordado com o telefone.","e":"I'm surprised the phone didn't wake you this morning.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.823739,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"97fd09963d32106d10e0170cc653918f","i":"1603471c4765edd24cf4f12d223e3add","r":"5466518:6812494:64:3697131","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5466518","6812494","64"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Estou surpreendida de te ver a pé tão cedo.","e":"I'm surprised you're up so early.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.826026,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"d3c95f08ce41f0123d9f3bf0d9b681d0","i":"2e9f188a9e70ce4c64916052c268aed4","r":"4278508:6652063:462:1238429","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4278508","6652063","462"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Diz que ficou surpreendida, terminou o curso há apenas uns anos.","e":"Well, she said she was surprised to get the call considering she just went back and got her degree a few years ago.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.681808,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"e318a41f2371d898ae0762b49706d66b","i":"4fa34e5b5599b2971f6a944a10652d51","r":"4776698:6787838:559:2953167","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4776698","6787838","559"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Não é nada bom ser surpreendida na minha própria casa.","e":"Ain't nothing cool about surprising me in my own house.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.851385,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"b6cb03436cd9af62ea870f461bca758b","i":"63dafbff81ec5e929aa1174719c89ea3","r":"5070302:6463891:530:2114428","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5070302","6463891","530"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Ficará surpreendida como o tempo corre aqui no instituto.","e":"You'll be surprised how time just slips away here at the institute.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.864755,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"0fef04cb947eac56f8fd07a95f48ec3d","i":"9fd712612f942343efd1767ce6ada802","r":"4731136:6994963:925:2922047","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4731136","6994963","925"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Estou surpreendida por ela não ter posto uma cadeira a seu lado.","e":"I'm surprised she didn't pull up a chair beside you.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.825808,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"9ab2529c8d27ac37a8e0eb586aff705b","i":"b3afedc4d84119a4549ad80c8e5bdeb8","r":"5767258:6933272:343:4678352","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5767258","6933272","343"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Numa família de assassinos, estou surpreendida em como outros não saíram.","e":"They're a family of killers. I'm surprised more of them don't want out.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.636027,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"04bb345115b5adc89df46e74e3bece8e","i":"d830483c1118d930c8b1006e6ecbc3ac","r":"6028546:7055819:326:4156965","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6028546","7055819","326"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"\"Vai ficar surpreendida por saber que penso muitas vezes em si.","e":"\"You'll be surprised to hear that I think of you often.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.836928,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"7e4a737f3cc70932f03bfc8894026901","i":"464bcfee66593feeeebedafeda4b2c79","r":"5475470:6564795:696:3709193","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5475470","6564795","696"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"O quê... eles não podem matar pessoas? Não, fiquei apenas surpreendida.","e":"No, I was just, surprised.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.460787,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"aac64711daa44eb9ca863bbe69052b71","i":"1c7024fa357afb0d07b54dda0fb42d7a","r":"5231680:7031789:102 103:4463897","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5231680","7031789","102 103"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Não estou surpreendida que ele tenha acabado como agente disfarçado.","e":"I'm not surprised he ended up in undercover.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.760781,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"a284ae2cb00affbf2f426150bff56b3a","i":"520f18f8f40dbc6d57977656d588c0b9","r":"5592142:6754174:305:3891414","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5592142","6754174","305"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Ficarias surpreendida com o número de pessoas que estão ao teu lado.","e":"You'd be surprised how many people are on your side.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.880493,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"e6c71600fa862edd34f2a35ea66483d5","i":"8b5223bc49fa94822014be4e8bce59cf","r":"3909144:6074660:673:705604","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["3909144","6074660","673"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Ela ficou surpreendida ao achar milhares de dólares escondidos no colchão da filha.","e":"She was surprised to find thousands of dollars hidden in her daughter's mattress.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.853401,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"84529e23b60e9b338a2bba9c240b24f8","i":"bd4acd941fc7d5eecee0478f21a9c8ba","r":"1302221:2750375","c":"alexmarcelo","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1302221","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1302221","b":"Tatoeba sentence #1302221 by alexmarcelo; English translation #2750375 by mervert1","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1302221","tu":1,"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Tipo: \"Quero parecer constantemente surpreendida. Como se estivesse prestes a comer um bebé.\"","e":"It's like, \"I wanna look constantly surprised... like I'm about to eat a baby.\"","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.839968,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"b85cf3b0e32a4ad96b12a40c93a13e33","i":"17230c51182848dcb8f6f1a95f82f92f","r":"6090102:6903705:1125 1126:4887573","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6090102","6903705","1125 1126"],"w":["leaf",0]}]]}}}